{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:eab852634c64ba3f4e69977057c874bc1fd540df2a9257c4b46d0c864819c3e6",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:553d5d600ea3ba720adbedc3191e2108e9c3667a6bf6831a4f82bc37b09dbc9f",
      "text": "巧合交织即必然",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad2a3602c4b00fd2343a92b450b6a1ad306e240983b1620f05ed1bde249a2b2b",
      "text": "大吾和一希决定参加315 Pro的试镜。试镜当天，一希偶然遇见了凉，并一同前往事务所。随后与大吾汇合。受到凉鼓舞的两人，迎向了试镜的挑战。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_a:cmd-000014:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3a0c7f8f83c9759bf38e90e810580beff52236c88683724b5c13d354d17d97d",
      "text": "第3话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_a:cmd-000014:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:553d5d600ea3ba720adbedc3191e2108e9c3667a6bf6831a4f82bc37b09dbc9f",
      "text": "巧合交织即必然",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_a:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe47635a170f26caae560c94c80a130957b552e8d2f6aab5827da016312bb7c4",
      "text": "喂，你们看这条新闻了吗？\n写着“秋月凉，从315 Pro重新出发！？”呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76c8d3e4565c0a3188fc915350e3e4cd189309310c7785904986e073713a8fc9",
      "text": "哇，好厉害啊。\n今后真的要作为男生进行活动了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7de02ace5ea8c3e1f8c1dafdd2a05bdd41d1b4b5453829cfe27b26c1c0a39771",
      "text": "那个节目，真是吓了一跳啊！\n不过，不管是怎样的凉酱我都会支持的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:199df173ed9eb56ceb329181796e68effec32a3ccebfa2430932259a663c4107",
      "text": "（……没想到俺会被那个315 Pro的制作人，\n邀请去参加试镜啊～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_a:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:458a29244363ff14754f227f8bdc42b95e10e5aa091936abdb227d11278f9d40",
      "text": "（嚯，试镜也有很多种啊！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bce96ab14efcc6ef39de694c6d4160b8cce6b8dc0c6bfd59a5e448d8c3268bbb",
      "text": "（有315 Pro单独举办的，\n也有和其他各个事务所联合举办的……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8df725fb9d76ee1912d05f2afa3d27d7d4a7b063b0e79286e03aa3974256297c",
      "text": "（两边看起来都很有意思，选不出来啊～！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_a:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5d67b2554ec8b8410a3a1097e702922e86cbb5470ac603fda2aeac9efd47aa3",
      "text": "（……因为与凉相遇而了解到的，\n偶像这份给人带来笑容的工作）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_a:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:193ec95c9fc5b1ebc62dacab042aa22eda09a172b428eb3f650dcb05e246fa77",
      "text": "（越听就觉得越有趣啊！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_a:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23ea785a61dde9f736a22c43cbba6426ce666d0a439c11045ded404cf33947b0",
      "text": "……嗯？这个名字是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c05286c94339847357605cfa75c2502a8af1e6a379a730fe3c24a8e8153fcea1",
      "text": "（这个事务所的，负责人……\n认识的人里好像有同名的呢～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68d1de39190bf9f58e3fb680e719d1340c6ed0057f92193ba2f20de01a64235b",
      "text": "噢，登了照片。……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:974b2a5459d9ffa14f26b57bdad5eae3a159463683b36448ddfb1e6ea6d62584",
      "text": "（……哎呀，不会错的。\n是和俺家有往来的那个人啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc275b8cde895770dded3345a7eb8b29986b7d0713bdd4b8289497df1699b82d",
      "text": "（要是俺去参加试镜的话，\n肯定会照顾俺吧……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c091b113935eecd651086eac8ae4de935ce143aa9e3f703d4a64aa8049cb2c8",
      "text": "……那，就得选没有这个事务所的试镜了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_b:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69ee1911a105434101786c66c85bcd985a90be08ed09a23b9b040800de93752f",
      "text": "（虽然时间很短，但俺好歹也是前第六代当家）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_b:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e345f1aa9f673686e9caf017ea4fd619a121d6983d25cddacb25dee33cb2a7cc",
      "text": "（身边的人全都是重情重义的家伙……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_b:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4faece0d007f00275e1fecd703f98cda3606d1fec2ff59290974e8f8bf67510f",
      "text": "就算拜托对方平等对待俺，\n也只会让对方为难而已啊～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_c:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e8d4b2fb30d92da951776036e3cc6d3e4584901ce34da642cb3a4e75361b9eb",
      "text": "大吾的老家",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_c:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d39c68bbc7e77b18c36d1c004d1938d6e457321e6d114197a43dcf85d865c265",
      "text": "……虽说是必要的，但警备还真森严啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_c:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b90576e017167d0e584b6ea6b3f25c3288a84639a6117a7d304527f0c6795f11",
      "text": "（今天是俺继承第六代当家的仪式。\n……即使像这样站在这里，也觉得心情很奇妙呢～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_c:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:169ed28f265cbc0af871205ab05345f3b07345e8e7ea804900158f6072f539a8",
      "text": "（在兄弟当中，俺明白自己是最受爷爷疼爱的……\n虽然明白归明白）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_c:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46e5a5b7f62eb14bf70aa85a97a7d0d9d8fe287cd8cdf76494635e6e7db150d4",
      "text": "没想到竟然打算让第五个儿子来继承家业，\n完全没料到啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1af0b1860e35301c2875a9d416641a51b2d263e4713a7110fcf124baca642335",
      "text": "（不过既然被选上了，就一定有原因）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_c:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c9556acbd14803917b2017c65a544741947d39d0a37314602d4dae88a4ae75a",
      "text": "（既然被托付了重任……而且\n既然已经答应了下来，就不能辜负期待！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_c:cmd-000075:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:317229e91d6ba6c45fca0754c38138394d350a2ce70fd3adb92a0ba939ef01dc",
      "text": "数个月后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_c:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2fcc41370c6c2c6799999b5e6529750cdc924014ad776c5430fb351837503033",
      "text": "！大哥，早……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_c:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_c:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17fe2c5c5b5e028d10f5d79faf652a5b96656482cba3761e18697199d88b3c8d",
      "text": "（……越过各位大哥，\n选了俺当当家，他们肯定不能接受吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_c:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca882f29f89d010dbd0121b650a3016f2619be8fe8ce08de0e655105ff025395",
      "text": "（从那天起，家里就越来越阴沉了……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_c:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a6fae057544475b5ea905bef062ddd4e153c2ffbdaf15c66a99d6c8503b1eb8",
      "text": "（笑容从家里消失可不行。\n最重要的是，这个家业最看重的就是家人的羁绊啊！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_c:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:234bbccf194bad829459c632d921c279f1bec6815b51d7ab10fe4a6f79d99d64",
      "text": "……俺决定了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_d:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0424e908f09f7621831e6e08142ec26bed574c1d9718850135c86a3aa08db37d",
      "text": "第七代继承仪式·宴会",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_d:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccb0f241b4d83d84c6584c36a2b2b385745add61cfbb08b9dd4511c14d4fe7ec",
      "text": "虽说宴席正酣，\n但在此请允许我说几句结束辞……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_d:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1346331ccd5b2abac287759a2c357d1c57880aa0f258a49b8fec1a50da86c87b",
      "text": "那么，祝愿今后蒸蒸日上……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f0e19fbfe39fbc0dd677e3673573ea526e172998c26224e25043436d30af155",
      "text": "（……这样就没问题了。一定……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_d:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74d53b087a395a829975f866a28f9ab16306ee30f2aec69fa0ab50622d9cfb21",
      "text": "爷爷，还有老爹、老妈。\n关于今后，俺有话想跟你们说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_d:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0bffd8ebfbd02ee987f761deb337509aaa2954710acf78c140c9564d84cc24b3",
      "text": "俺打算去东京的宅邸。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_d:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:690c7d1a78c2ea075126a8b1c6b3c549ee9c5c2f6207c89de1de0489abb18b6a",
      "text": "虽然已经把当家位置让给大哥了……\n但俺要是留在这里，大家都会心神不宁吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_d:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dfcea5dbf380ac7acf155151d66348afbac1cf12e6779f808c1502003685779c",
      "text": "听说有几个小弟要跟着俺，没事的。\n俺会应付好的，不会给大家添麻烦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_d:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6185917c01f40c6039bd57e8b4870710e6b042485dab83f4c9505ab8111dc377",
      "text": "而且，俺也会尽可能联络的。\n所以，别担心俺！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_d:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fcc0586ca49e1af794f2167d391c79d969b00a16870306e56c87295ab0d40c4e",
      "text": "（……嗯。看了各种各样的，但果然\n315 Pro单独的试镜最好啊！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_d:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:500782bc27cfa1aed8e47c1904f740e6071344ddd2d51be9d868b90f8bcfb115",
      "text": "（凉也在，要进的话，俺想进这里。\n那个叫制作人的人，看起来也很温柔）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_d:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34b711d684897120ec04d30b9d59f42f66aa2debb99b4e201a496f32f8cb1656",
      "text": "对了，跟爷爷也顺便提一句吧。\n久违地打个电话，他应该会很高兴吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_e:cmd-000015:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2a40248a047b34eca4002dcdf855823097e67ae97e2d83de4a83373b48f972a",
      "text": "数周后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_e:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3556cc69a0b0e0ef36ff20c97a9a65392a9b9743e91cb5b6a040e653651a971a",
      "text": "……呼……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce66deb8d6b302e955cb1e6431609852c073b824ee8439b91f7b9d63444bc9f9",
      "text": "（…真没想到，居然会晕车）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_e:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:acab5c720425b2847b5cc77ad70b097b1560e553691efd3fc833ed844bf7da1a",
      "text": "（…平时吃的晕车药没起作用。\n……恐怕是因为紧张吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_e:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee7dccde6da436ac037fd97db85b1d298ac0d4ddeb531d7c6706f7670e7fa8b3",
      "text": "…麻烦了。这样下去的话，赶不上预定的时间……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_e:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa0159de6fcecd7329996878ebf32b28bd2e5eabb7b6bd0db49fd973593fa7e2",
      "text": "那个，你没事吧？\n总觉得你脸色不太好……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_e:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:525693d56008d388a187630ae9c2173eb3ba99642a86d89568c78eb71aac8558",
      "text": "（…！……难道是，秋月凉……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_e:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf2389c46cea5c28aa9a7feea3955f4cc16dcf46e35c7dfb8afdb962710ba16d",
      "text": "…只是老毛病，晕车了而已。\n稍微休息一下，就会好些……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_e:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0046025ef612576b8e430e2cf7d3bacbe89c8b51164f25e1a545fe7570f1f57c",
      "text": "（呜呜，这表情完全没有说服力啊～！\n不能就这么放着不管……对了！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_e:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b22c44334f76a71ff02585e5edbe6cef737207de099f321cf45c320cd1cbdb15",
      "text": "……啊，喂喂。我是秋月！\n现在事务所附近，有个身体好像很不舒服的人……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_e:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3dbf8ecf9871a9244be3b8e79296df564a29aa293f118d0d10d3a2891696d542",
      "text": "（…“秋月”。果然是电视上看到的那个人）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_e:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c5fc8629a906dbd9af956bd1dd1ce2df6779528d6334147acd00992736f8db2",
      "text": "（…没想到会在这种地方遇到……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_f:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bcf91aac2d36ba6ea21183a766ed4ab7e568ed1787ac44f6adc8bb6680029e2e",
      "text": "好的，非常感谢！\n那我问问看这个人吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_f:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2d4b9e6e85367275b937c8175b2e40caf1d6d55e33ffae7bbebc31c6e378ac6",
      "text": "那个。不介意的话，就在附近有个可以休息的地方。\n要不要去那里慢慢歇一会儿？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_f:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:614883c3b644bdfb4dcea076e8a9fee61acdd6f982e893afddd4faac33c398d6",
      "text": "有可以躺下的沙发，也有洗手间，\n各种准备都很……啊，奇怪？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_f:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4fe452726c318d8056a3b00da2ee7a93f436203d6e55dee9d4273eb1c2f84d3",
      "text": "（完全没有反应……啊！\n难道说，是在怀疑我！？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_f:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2e98ff8ff9a2c5a9a21fee00ae7206e7969869978318abc97a9e4d9007b6d11",
      "text": "（确实，突然要把人带去哪里的话，\n怎么看都很可疑啊～～！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_f:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ec2227ec58db8eabfa0ecebc0c4b5a55a56bce3768dd02921a246dfaa669a10",
      "text": "没、没事的，不是奇怪的地方！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_f:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb8d3e224741d24a357e8805471bbe869456ef782c2c29a60abb48993a739e83",
      "text": "是承蒙关照的、\n叫做315 Production的偶像事务所……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_f:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58ff07f9198ead35e7a4a896e9c0bb33b722955863bbc6d155cc7ca93b11d2d4",
      "text": "…我正好，就是要去那里的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_f:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a",
      "text": "诶？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_f:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5171098c7f6ed205f9bc129ca10e3d3748a4ff4168c42fbe4e3b98bc25b3890a",
      "text": "…去参加今天举行的试镜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_f:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15",
      "text": "诶诶！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_g:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc639f3777b73fa315e6c9ab8a27d42d17e60ae215ebf0f285911b664b51911e",
      "text": "那里就是315 Production的事务所。\n那个，身体状况怎么样了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_g:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84e951c24f54067b73f518a0a04f88c6d4a128abf4d696b30ba579f5c836d0ba",
      "text": "…走了一会儿路，好像好多了。\n谢谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_g:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0853fcb76c5fb747b7339fc3b97475adb758962cf65102e211d6b75f394a0bdc",
      "text": "太好了！哎呀？\n在那里的难道是……喂——，大吾君！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_g:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:029c0d918ed8096c7735b923ae298c831eb8988a76644684895b4df2c65a1e77",
      "text": "噢，凉。好久不见啦～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_g:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:acb11d4238a8f74abbc79958a0af76e094d1ba98e5574d2d5357a237e79abc0e",
      "text": "好久不见！能再见到你真开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_g:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2f5fafd4d79ec4a106264bb8744ef8d87ba6fbfe526ee22f777499f53044ad4",
      "text": "俺也是！\n难道说，你听说了今天的事？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_g:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0b631667645472db2412b4195a0c169c4cab533b85f6f24e0771d0ee3ea76b9",
      "text": "嗯。制作人告诉我了。\n所以有点在意，就跑过来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_g:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6c33e6e52f0e2b645f41e46b3769450758c7b5bd1da4d6f5623d020b24728d8b",
      "text": "这样啊，谢啦！\n旁边的那位，是和凉同一个315 Pro的偶像吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_g:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:82314eadffff92e97218f0b3e01822c54cbb02288e05d93e236a0eced064da17",
      "text": "不是，是和大吾君参加同一个试镜的，\n九十九一希先生。刚才碰巧遇到了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_g:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e0060120e80f5e13af2fff466c5ee4312157b7d4335df702173cfd1e84708e9",
      "text": "那么，一起合格的话就是同期了呢！\n俺是兜大吾，请多关照啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_g:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e9d3ad381b618f4f8fb67f30f69a717c06ebeacf72391900dbbdb4b22c74b0d",
      "text": "…啊。我这边也是，请多指教。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_g:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f28bcf7b80f55c8bd758ab2a2ce142fce95b00d930022aea09321027c4c9b3a",
      "text": "你们两个，试镜要加油哦！\n我会为你们加油的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_h:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4eaff4655acad93c6d4456d8bae64053c58d00d981319380ffbd802a4469305c",
      "text": "那么接下来，\n试镜正式开始。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_h:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c167e8efa62cd9c745e4bd2cc22c542f7302e8b7faa471a937b37abfb1aef46a",
      "text": "首先，请两位做个自我介绍。\n能从兜大吾先生开始吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_h:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7494a44a79198eb6b884eeebfcc884e6ab19d09cd8c91d78368ae4258df7eb66",
      "text": "重新介绍一下，俺是兜大吾。出身地是广岛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_h:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4363ccf03922c0ed7a06e26af216190ecfe4fcac90de101f202d19b4d9111b8",
      "text": "14岁，爱好是格斗游戏。\n曾经在街机厅的排行榜上拿过第一名哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_h:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c522a1b5a2b7caeace53f89422bb01591218597076eed1bb016f3ed0134b78d",
      "text": "…我是九十九一希。爱好是读书。\n不久前自己也一直在写书。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_h:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c6b5950f7755384191f1a26c007b9e43b944bfed612c371dda2f2521f0a3913",
      "text": "…请多关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_h:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9da1b9351c7651bfd1266ef69623922a2f917c59ea52a8637a014c216b6a6b0",
      "text": "两位都很厉害呢。\n有的拿过第一名，有的写过书……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_h:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1534852a259154c37e0d38c6ed30a4fb086c5d62c6dc4cdbaff176651de93d1",
      "text": "噢！因为家里工作的关系，\n俺也统率过很多人哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_h:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc4dbe1427002b3963c0e55e4c7b5581878faeb8722c4afb584719be1c5e3c9b",
      "text": "所以，不管是登顶还是当领导者都很有经验！\n……具体是什么工作就保密啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_h:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9315e3d126281af7e17d7482b5ada4570ca741d1271da54d6b814fd3edc7567a",
      "text": "非常感谢！\n那么接下来，进入实技环节。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_h:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f37e59502fa8a9483b9084977d56c8e5a4fe966c578105f512b85c1b527d221",
      "text": "首先希望展现一下二位的演技，\n请试着表演一下刚才我发给两位的剧本！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_h:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:372c951e23615f786a7712c56c633675a78a75d36532badb958dd56c0b560297",
      "text": "接下来会留出一点时间阅读剧本。\n两位也可以就内容进行商讨。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_h:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d2cde6aff8683abfefcb155c7e779ae907beea5a2c22476abad347501e1bb62",
      "text": "我们先暂时离开一下。\n那么，失陪了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_h:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e7d92c4115a5a38ece02c0c265f75445729c3dbaab60ef2f02ac46fcc0331a0",
      "text": "哦哦——这就是剧本啊。\n演电视剧什么的也是这种……嗯？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_h:cmd-000165:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:623a7634b17a2c3265b3a97de7b7d119e42e5cc7dbdb6352f76f23c21291a303",
      "text": "（这个剧本……相、相当难懂啊！？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_i:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7472f69fb57e1f76cd3eed8603bc2233d61887ccc33131dc4467a8add890306c",
      "text": "那个……这句台词，说的是什么啊？\n好生僻的说辞啊。唔～……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_i:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6c6a6007ec5f061204185622f3a360e335106e0625f2987f751e3a43c3b0523a",
      "text": "…虽然是用古文般的表达，但意思是这样的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_i:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20eea3d7e0d702329f2941dddc63f0fbbe42d0c6adf86c5df46da6a17cc24143",
      "text": "…“如果能和态度冷淡的你，再次一同观赏\n那渐渐泛白的云彩颜色该有多好”……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_i:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea7603e9e8d54c91180104c159897d51bc1c35bd520b6a81c93a798523088867",
      "text": "…翻回到这一页的话，\n就能明白她为什么会说出这种话的心情了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_i:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52d81fef6db22f718058fa57c20a33299263a1aebff17aab9f3cf99499538eb7",
      "text": "哦哦，真的诶。\n故事一口气全钻进脑子里了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_i:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6151588c9d95978e11687a09f42489353e76f6ce7a2972c7f65c00e25ebcff1c",
      "text": "你真的太厉害了～\n我说我说，以后俺能叫你“老师”吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_i:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5034e37e3c724d0f4776f7ac02afa3f47e49e68542a2c33fe4af6ec37f1d066e",
      "text": "…别这样。我已经，不是小说家了。\n而且，我的书，全都是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_i:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64dbb5920b10d67d5557a104f9ff4fc3c92724d835610afc0a4fbf33b06e67f9",
      "text": "啊，不是那个意思，\n只是单纯地尊敬你啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_i:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36211a25035785e3a6f0b33b91540dd4bb7d3f1e693ed868181418713aa698d6",
      "text": "又能写书，人又聪明，再加上\n还对今天刚认识的俺这么亲切。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_i:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2a221ed38aa6a8dc2ce47887378ede6c540baffe1b8cea4516a1a32795ddd2e",
      "text": "冲着这份气度，俺就想这么叫你！\n不行吗～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_i:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:110dad690d200a38f25b278bbd370100535fac299e11294bd251f2b90254959a",
      "text": "（…只是，看着我本身……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_i:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fee6f242448783a955711eba597ed31dd2a9c0f60393cfaecf3057d19b7dac0b",
      "text": "…如果是这样的话……\n你想这么叫，我也无所谓。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_j:cmd-000015:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ebd5474b65c822bd9cb17309f1613816b08754869a0b6db55d63780049ac6d4e",
      "text": "试镜结束后",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_j:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91f8eddd3ab45d5d45ba3f7c86205752f95b4fa55daae9013ce1f5c198807525",
      "text": "…辛苦了。\n试镜能顺利结束真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_j:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e468a621d697d36fa70d63f0385a5054bdd61e0ce9a784b113027285b85ac1d",
      "text": "老师也辛苦啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_j:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31022812811394f20d92d5a975bfcb2cf913e50147d65fba3ee473de8edac09d",
      "text": "不过话说回来，那份剧本。\n虽然俺也觉得有点奇怪……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_j:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1985a9bdabc897c29903be1434be89e58c51026ecadcd9dd3798552f720a0007",
      "text": "…竟然是因为事务员的失误，导致有几个词被转换\n成了古语。……这种事也是会有的吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_j:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a0ea7694a14e3c1d8d4af9e1c97b4d99cbbce3675f627f2bbae1291ca1cf6e7",
      "text": "嗯，多亏了那个才能和老师搞好关系。\n真是值得感谢的失误啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_j:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49a3b47931fe51a1096de5b32e5dfc6c0669c48a82c722b973d5cf8eecddd32b",
      "text": "…是啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_j:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7fb3dbdd190989077a8ca1bc32f6760bb015f48bfcfb386f1dd1cf5837eac1db",
      "text": "我说，之后有空吗？\n俺和凉约好了见面，要不要一起去？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_j:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a90433da4b441d59178b165950b2f39ea26782aa72815e9db88f8ade8849de7d",
      "text": "…我也能去吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_j:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9458e475ccb08262fc09a189576f40663cbae2a91a5ea5c9f1cb7d63f45071de",
      "text": "当然啦！\n俺还想跟老师多聊聊，凉肯定也会高兴的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_j:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0867f12403418a04fd9a1e34332214dc53ad3426f069c707625ca787f82cbb3",
      "text": "…这样啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_j:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af5d6beba336d94877300b40656db86cef92284b46357193efcae09626548375",
      "text": "（…我也，希望能让人了解真正的自己。\n哪怕，无法全盘托出……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_j:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10c417c0c2fec760100a49a45bda231076dea2e64a2106237f4db5dffd217239",
      "text": "…谢谢你。那我就恭敬不如从命了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
